{"step_index":696,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:02:13Z","input_tokens":2738,"cache_read_tokens":255581,"output_tokens":2931,"thinking":"The Stage 4 scanner requires building a unified script to process the remaining missing company data. The process will involve querying Naver SmartPlace and Search. The search query structure will be tailored to each company, appending \"부산 전화번호\" (Busan phone number) to a cleaned company name. Results will be validated by extracting phone numbers from specific HTML elements or snippets, followed by address verification via district, dong, or road mentions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nfunction cleanName(raw) {\\n  if (!raw) return '';\\n  return raw\\n    .replace(/\\\\(주\\\\)/g, '')\\n    .replace(/주식회사/g, '')\\n    .replace(/\\\\(유\\\\)/g, '')\\n    .replace(/\\\\(합\\\\)/g, '')\\n    .replace(/\\\\(유책\\\\)/g, '')\\n    .replace(/유한책임회사/g, '')\\n    .replace(/유한회사/g, '')\\n    .trim();\\n}\\n\\nfunction cleanPhoneNumber(raw) {\\n  if (!raw) return null;\\n  let p = raw.trim().replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\\n  p = p.replace(/^\\\\+82\\\\s*/, '');\\n  if (p.startsWith('51-')) p = '0' + p;\\n  if (p.startsWith('2-')) p = '0' + p;\\n  if (p.startsWith('10-')) p = '0' + p;\\n  if (p.startsWith('31-')) p = '0' + p;\\n  if (p.startsWith('70-')) p = '0' + p;\\n\\n  const prefixMatch = p.match(/^(?:02|051|031)-(1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4})$/);\\n  if (prefixMatch) p = prefixMatch[1];\\n\\n  // Exclude invalid CS numbers\\n  if (['02-1577-0000', '1577-0000', '02-6226-5000', '02-6937-0035'].includes(p)) 